## 4. Database Schema (Prisma + PostgreSQL)

### 4.1 Connection Setup

```typescript
// lib/db/prisma.ts
// Menggunakan pg Pool + PrismaPg adapter
// - Singleton pattern via globalThis (dev: reuse, prod: new instance)
// - Fail-fast jika DATABASE_URL tidak di-set
// - Log level: development = ['error', 'warn'], production = ['error']
```

**Logic flow**:

1. Baca `DATABASE_URL` dari env
2. Jika kosong → throw Error langsung (bukan tunggu query gagal)
3. Buat `pg.Pool` → reuse di development via `globalThis`
4. Buat `PrismaPg` adapter dari pool
5. Buat `PrismaClient` dengan adapter → reuse di development

### 4.2 Model-Model Database

#### User (Admin CMS)

```prisma
model User {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  email        String   @unique
  name         String?
  role         Role     @default(AUTHOR)  // ADMIN | AUTHOR
  avatarUrl    String?
  passwordHash String?
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt
  posts        Post[]
  @@map("users")
}
```

**Logic**:

- `role` menentukan akses dashboard (ADMIN = full access, AUTHOR = limited)
- `passwordHash` di-hash dengan bcryptjs (cost 12)
- Admin bisa dibuat via script `scripts/create-admin.ts`

#### Post (Blog Articles)

```prisma
model Post {
  id              String      @id @default(cuid())
  title           String
  slug            String      @unique
  content         String      // HTML dari TipTap editor
  excerpt         String?
  featuredImage   String?     // Cloudinary URL
  status          PostStatus  @default(DRAFT)  // DRAFT|PUBLISHED|SCHEDULED|ARCHIVED
  publishedAt     DateTime?
  scheduledAt     DateTime?   // untuk auto-publish via cron
  readingTime     Int?        // auto-calculated dari word count
  
  // WordPress migration fields
  wpId            Int?        @unique
  wpGuid          String?
  
  // SEO fields
  metaTitle       String?
  metaDescription String?
  focusKeyword    String?
  focusKeywords   String?     // multiple keywords
  canonicalUrl    String?
  ogImage         String?
  ogTitle         String?
  ogDescription   String?
  schemaType      String?
  schemaData      String?     // JSON-LD
  internalLinks   String?     // JSON array
  
  // Provenance
  source          String      @default("manual")  // manual|ai|agent
  createdVia      String?     // dashboard, api, agent-name
  
  // Relations
  authorId        String?
  author          User?       @relation(...)
  categories      CategoriesOnPosts[]
  tags            TagsOnPosts[]
  
  @@index([slug])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([publishedAt])
  @@index([scheduledAt])
  @@map("posts")
}
```

**Logic kritis**:

- `content` di-sanitize sebelum disimpan (lihat §6.4)
- `readingTime` dihitung otomatis: `Math.max(1, Math.ceil(wordCount / 200))`
- `slug` harus unique — ada collision resolver yang append `-2`, `-3`, dst
- Status flow: `DRAFT → PUBLISHED`, `DRAFT → SCHEDULED → PUBLISHED` (via cron)
- Publish validation: judul min 10 karakter, konten min 120 kata, excerpt/metaDescription wajib

#### Category

```prisma
model Category {
  id          String @id @default(cuid())
  name        String
  slug        String @unique  // auto-generated dari name
  description String?
  wpId        Int?   @unique  // untuk migrasi
  posts       CategoriesOnPosts[]
  @@map("categories")
}
```

#### Tag

```prisma
model Tag {
  id     String @id @default(cuid())
  name   String
  slug   String @unique
  wpId   Int?   @unique
  posts  TagsOnPosts[]
  @@map("tags")
}
```

#### Many-to-Many Relations

```prisma
model CategoriesOnPosts {
  post       Post     @relation(...)
  postId     String
  category   Category @relation(...)
  categoryId String
  assignedAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@id([postId, categoryId])
  @@map("categories_on_posts")
}

model TagsOnPosts {
  post   Post @relation(...)
  postId String
  tag    Tag  @relation(...)
  tagId  String
  assignedAt DateTime @default(now())
  @@id([postId, tagId])
  @@map("tags_on_posts")
}
```

**Logic**: Explicit join table (bukan implicit `@relation`) supaya bisa track `assignedAt` dan onDelete cascade.

#### Page (Static Pages)

